# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# dependencies
# Stage S0 (npm workspaces monorepo): unanchored, not just /node_modules —
# a workspace package can end up with its own nested node_modules, and the
# old root-anchored pattern silently stopped matching apps/web/node_modules
# etc. entirely once the app moved out of the repo root.
node_modules
.pnp
.pnp.js
.yarn/install-state.gz

# testing
coverage

# next.js
# Same anchoring fix as above — this now needs to match apps/web/.next/,
# not just a repo-root .next/ that no longer exists.
.next/
out/

# production
build

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# local env files
.env*.local

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# next-pwa generated files
# **/ prefix: these patterns have an internal slash (public/x), which git
# treats as anchored to the .gitignore's own directory unless explicitly
# told otherwise — needs to match apps/web/public/sw.js now, not a
# repo-root public/ that no longer holds the Next app's static files.
**/public/sw.js
**/public/workbox-*.js
**/public/worker-*.js
**/public/sw.js.map
**/public/workbox-*.js.map
**/public/worker-*.js.map
**/public/fallback-*.js

# editor / OS
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
Thumbs.db

# ECC / agent scratch
.ecc/

.vercel
.env*

# Local working files, not part of the product
.playwright-cli/
androidstudio-screenshot/
docs/product-discovery.zip
docs/strategy/
docs/implementation/CLAUDE-INTEGRATION.md
docs/brand/brand-strategy-v1.0-superseded.md
assets/brand/_archive-concept/

# Promo video output (large, regenerated)
gloat-output/
